# The Figure 1 map pipeline. It needs sf, terra, elevatr, rayshader, rayrender,
# rgl, whitebox, osmdata and tidyterra -- roughly doubling the lockfile and
# requiring GDAL and an OpenGL stack in the container -- while its output is
# committed as figures/study_area.png and the README marks it optional. It is
# run on its own; see paper/map/README.md. The packages are recorded under
# Suggests in DESCRIPTION so the requirement is still written down.
paper/map/
